# SCENARIO: baseline_b7b_local_probe   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 3 (lean) B7 follow-up: B7 got 0 local replies to 15 keyword lines at the depot. Here each
# `say` is preceded by the server state of the nearest bot (`status`), so a 0 can be told apart:
# no IDLE/DWELLING bot within 7 tiles (spec: no reply) vs an eligible bot that stays silent.
# Spec: nearest IDLE/DWELLING, same z, <= 7 tiles, 60 s per-bot cooldown, replyChancePct 60.
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32369,32228,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 as=N1
@srv cmd "$N1" status
@p1 say hi
@p1 hold 12
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$N1 timeout=60 as=N2
@srv cmd "$N2" status
@p1 say hello
@p1 hold 12
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$N1,$N2 timeout=60 as=N3
@srv cmd "$N3" status
@p1 say hey
@p1 hold 12
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$N1,$N2,$N3 timeout=60 as=N4
@srv cmd "$N4" status
@p1 say yo
@p1 hold 12
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$N1,$N2,$N3,$N4 timeout=60 as=N5
@srv cmd "$N5" status
@p1 say thanks
@p1 hold 12
@p1 dump-view
@p1 logout
